  "summary": {
    "text": "SmolVLM2 extends Hugging Face's SmolVLM vision-language models to video, taking video, images and text as input and producing text. It was released with open weights under Apache 2.0 in 2.2B, 500M and 256M sizes, with MLX support from launch; Hugging Face showed an iPhone app that runs the 500M model locally.",
    "sources": [
