  "notes": "Three sizes released together (2.2B, 500M, 256M), with MLX support from day one. Hugging Face's SmolVLM paper (arXiv v1, 2025-04-07) documents the SmolVLM models from 256M to 2.2B, including video. Context window left out: the paper adopts a 16k-token context for SmolVLM and 8k for smaller variants without naming SmolVLM2, and the 2.2B Instruct configuration lists 8192 positions. The card lists SmolLM2-1.7B-Instruct as the text decoder and Google's SigLIP as image encoder (cross-organisation, not recorded)."
